@CarPointCloudWebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5031
@IdempotencyKey = pointcloud-demo-001
@Timestamp = replace-with-current-unix-milliseconds
@Signature = replace-with-lowercase-md5-of-timestamp-plus-secret
@Cursor = paste-X-Next-Cursor-from-previous-response

# 所有受保护接口都需要 Timestamp 与 Signature。
# PowerShell 生成示例（密钥从环境变量读取，不要写入本文件）：
# $ts=[DateTimeOffset]::UtcNow.ToUnixTimeMilliseconds().ToString(); $md5=[Security.Cryptography.MD5]::Create(); $sig=[Convert]::ToHexString($md5.ComputeHash([Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetBytes($ts+$env:INTEGRATION_APP_SECRET))).ToLowerInvariant()

### Query latest vehicle dimensions
GET {{CarPointCloudWebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vehicleDimensions?limit=10
Accept: application/json
Timestamp: {{Timestamp}}
Signature: {{Signature}}

### Continue vehicle dimensions with an opaque cursor (do not combine with limit/timeWindow)
GET {{CarPointCloudWebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vehicleDimensions?cursor={{Cursor}}
Accept: application/json
Timestamp: {{Timestamp}}
Signature: {{Signature}}

### Query coal volumes by recent time window
GET {{CarPointCloudWebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/coalVolumes?timeWindow=30
Accept: application/json
Timestamp: {{Timestamp}}
Signature: {{Signature}}

### Fetch license plate from partner system
POST {{CarPointCloudWebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/licensePlateRecords/fetch?cameraIdentifier=CAMERA_001
Accept: application/json
Timestamp: {{Timestamp}}
Signature: {{Signature}}

### Ingest point cloud vehicle dimensions
POST {{CarPointCloudWebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/internal/pointcloud/vehicleDimensions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{IdempotencyKey}}
Timestamp: {{Timestamp}}
Signature: {{Signature}}

{
  "cameraIdentifier": "CAMERA_001",
  "licensePlate": "JING_A12345",
  "detectStatus": "success",
  "dimensions": {
    "cabToTrailerFrontDist": 132.24,
    "trailerLength": 960.04,
    "trailerWidth": 255.0,
    "trailerBodyHeight": 180.36,
    "trailerBottomToGroundHeight": 120.0,
    "highLowPlateHeight": 30.0
  },
  "highLowPlates": [
    { "plateId": 1, "highestToGround": 220.0, "lowestToGround": 190.0 }
  ],
  "ribs": [
    { "ribId": 1, "distToPrev": 50.0 },
    { "ribId": 2, "distToPrev": 52.4 }
  ],
  "wires": [
    { "wireId": 1, "distToPrev": 40.0 },
    { "wireId": 2, "distToPrev": 42.8 }
  ],
  "sourceFile": "D:\\data\\pointcloud\\CAMERA_001.pcd",
  "resultJsonPath": "D:\\data\\pointcloud\\CAMERA_001.json",
  "resultImagePath": "D:\\data\\pointcloud\\CAMERA_001.png"
}

### Anonymous internal radar arrival; event_id is optional but recommended for safe retries
POST {{CarPointCloudWebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/radar/vehicle-arrival
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: radar-arrival-demo-001

{
  "device_id": "RADAR_001",
  "cameraIdentifier": "CAM004",
  "timestamp": "2026-08-01 12:00:00",
  "event_type": "ARRIVAL",
  "event_id": "radar-arrival-demo-001"
}

### Ingest coal volume
POST {{CarPointCloudWebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/internal/pointcloud/coalVolumes
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: coal-demo-001
Timestamp: {{Timestamp}}
Signature: {{Signature}}

{
  "cameraIdentifier": "CAMERA_001",
  "licensePlate": "JING_A12345",
  "volume": 36.86,
  "unit": "m3",
  "status": "success",
  "confidence": 0.92,
  "sourceFile": "D:\\data\\pointcloud\\loaded.pcd",
  "baselineFile": "D:\\data\\pointcloud\\empty.pcd"
}

### 磅房实时点云：雷达与预览状态（需 admin/viewer 的 JWT）
GET {{CarPointCloudWebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/radar-live/status
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}

### 磅房实时点云：拉取比 0 号更新的一帧融合预览
# 响应中的 points 是 base64(Float32 小端 xyz 交错)，前 pointCountA 个点来自 CAM_004。
# updated=false 表示没有新画面，不是错误。
GET {{CarPointCloudWebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/radar-live/fused-frame?afterVersion=0
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}

### 磅房实时点云：保存 PCD 并计算（仅 admin）
# 车牌由操作员输入并绑定到本次流程；命中已有空车档案时先返回 409，
# 需确认后带 confirmOverwriteEmptyProfile=true 重试。
# Idempotency-Key 必填：请求超时时无法判断 Worker 是否已受理，
# 换个新键重试会再采一次、再写一条来车与尺寸记录。重放时响应 duplicate=true。
POST {{CarPointCloudWebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/radar-live/captures
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}
Idempotency-Key: live-20260905-0001

{
  "licensePlate": "宁A10333F",
  "confirmOverwriteEmptyProfile": false,
  "note": "磅房人工采集"
}

### 磅房实时点云：人工核实后强制重发
# 仅在上一次返回 409 needs_manual_confirmation 时使用。
# 服务端无法核实上一次是否已经采集（Worker 可能重启过），必须由操作员到现场确认
# 本车确实没有采过，再用同一个幂等键带 forceRedispatch 重发。
POST {{CarPointCloudWebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/radar-live/captures
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}
Idempotency-Key: live-20260905-0001

{
  "licensePlate": "宁A10333F",
  "forceRedispatch": true
}

### 磅房实时点云：查询采集进度
# stage 只有 completed 才代表 DM8 已落库；captured/saved/analyzing 都不是。
GET {{CarPointCloudWebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/radar-live/captures/sess_20260905140000000_0123456789ab
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}

### 磅房实时点云：取消当前采集（仅 admin）
# 归属校验由 Worker 在协调器锁内完成；当前会话不属于该流程时返回 409 request_mismatch。
POST {{CarPointCloudWebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/radar-live/captures/sess_20260905140000000_0123456789ab/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}
